# S-021 NAL unit arrays of the hvcC record: counts, SEI arrays, limits.
# numOfArrays counts the non-empty arrays. Completeness bit: 1 for VPS/SPS/PPS arrays, 0 for SEI arrays.
# At most 16 VPS, 16 SPS, 64 PPS; more than that (or none at all) is a failure (see 35-...).
# with a prefix SEI (39)
